local geometry replaces Rust dependency implementations.

The optional matching fitter independently implements the mathematical
area/first-moment construction described by Raph Levien in Fitting cubic
Bézier curves (2021), https://raphlinus.github.io/curves/2021/03/11/bezier-fitting.html.
LevienCubicFitter.swift and FitPolynomial.swift are beztrace work; no Kurbo
implementation is translated or linked into the Swift library.

